B.DD=new A.mG("Chat Check","Objectively measure your digital communication dynamics to stop overthinking message lengths, reply times, and who texts first.",'Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT) shows that anxiety in relationships often comes from subjective "mind-reading"\u2014guessing their tone or intentions behind a screen. By evaluating observable data (like initiation ratios, reply stability, and spontaneous sharing), you shift your brain from anxious speculation to objective reality. Recognizing these concrete patterns interrupts the emotional haze and restores your peace of mind.',B.WY,B.Ve,"Objective Check",!1,"")
