B.DC=new A.mG("Depth & Boundary Radar","Map the true depth of your emotional connection and evaluate if your personal boundaries are being respected or compromised.","Healthy relationships rely on a balance between mutual vulnerability and clear emotional boundaries. When you constantly suppress your needs or carry the emotional labor alone, it breeds chronic anxiety and resentment. Objectively mapping these dynamics helps you recognize unequal effort, protect your energy, and establish safe boundaries without guilt.",B.UZ,B.V4,"Objective Check",!1,"")
