B.DF=new A.mG("Mind-Reading Filter Analysis","Identify and clear the subjective filters that cause you to over-analyze tones, emojis, and hidden meanings in communication.",'In cognitive psychology, "mind-reading" is a distortion where we assume we know someone else\'s intentions without direct facts. When vulnerable, we project our internal insecurities onto their short replies or silence, often mistaking a neutral tone for coldness or rejection. Recognizing these cognitive filters allows you to separate subjective imagination from reality, instantly reducing emotional overthinking.',B.US,B.TD,"Cognitive Bias Test",!1,"")
